---
/*
 * Design
 * Field: the jobs family (blue or sky), set by fieldColor(); Claude Code in the field's focus color.
 * Detail chart on white: deep jobs blue #145A93 for the leader; grey for the rest.
 * Signature: strict counts drawn solid or hatched, with an outline behind showing the
 *   looser plain-word count, so the reader sees how much the definition moves each tool.
 */
import BarList from "@site/components/charts/BarList.astro";
import Figure from "@site/components/charts/Figure.astro";
import { REPO, isoDate, longDate, number, type Lang } from "@site/i18n";
import receipt from "../data/receipt.json";
import tools from "../data/tools.json";
import anyTool from "../queries/any-tool.json";
import claude from "../queries/claude-code.json";
import codex from "../queries/codex.json";
import copilot from "../queries/github-copilot.json";
import cursor from "../queries/cursor.json";
import windsurf from "../queries/windsurf.json";

interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
  section: "card" | "body" | "method";
  size?: "compact" | "full";
  entry: { slug: string; snapshot?: Date; exploration_credits?: number };
}

const { lang, section, size = "compact", entry } = Astro.props;
const zh = lang === "zh";
const snapshot = entry.snapshot ?? new Date(tools.snapshot);

const names: Record<string, string> = {
  "claude-code": "Claude Code",
  cursor: "Cursor",
  "github-copilot": "GitHub Copilot",
  codex: "Codex",
  windsurf: "Windsurf",
};
const rows = tools.rows as { group: string; count: number; us_count: number; word_count?: number }[];
const max = Math.max(...rows.map((r) => r.word_count ?? r.count));
const lead = rows[0];
const pct = (x: number) => `${number(lang, x * 100, 0)}%`;
const any = tools.any_tool_count;
const barRows = rows.map((r) => ({
  label: names[r.group],
  note:
    r.word_count !== undefined
      ? zh
        ? `严格计数：需同时提到另一个工具；只看这个词 ${number(lang, r.word_count)}`
        : `strict count: another tool named too; the word alone ${number(lang, r.word_count)}`
      : undefined,
  display: number(lang, r.count),
  width: r.count / max,
  ghost: r.word_count !== undefined ? r.word_count / max : undefined,
  kind: r.group === lead.group ? ("focus" as const) : r.word_count !== undefined ? ("lower" as const) : ("other" as const),
}));
const byUs = [...rows].sort((a, b) => b.us_count / b.count - a.us_count / a.count);
const lowestUs = byUs[byUs.length - 1];
---

{
  section === "card" && (
    <div class={`card-body size-${size}`}>
      <p class="big-number">{number(lang, lead.count)}</p>
      <p class="big-label">
        {zh
          ? `个在招岗位的职位描述里提到 Claude Code，共 ${number(lang, any)} 个岗位至少提到五个工具之一。`
          : `open postings name Claude Code in the description. ${number(lang, any)} name at least one of the five tools.`}
      </p>
      <ul class="mini-bars" aria-label={zh ? "各工具被提到的岗位数" : "Postings naming each tool"}>
        {rows.map((r) => (
          <li class={r.group === lead.group ? "focus" : r.word_count !== undefined ? "lower" : undefined}>
            <span>{names[r.group]}</span>
            <span class="mb-track">
              <span class="mb-fill" style={`--w: ${((r.count / max) * 100).toFixed(2)}%`} />
            </span>
            <span class="mb-value">{number(lang, r.count)}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <p class="mb-key">
        {zh ? "斜线条是严格计数：只在同时提到另一个 AI 编程工具时才计入。条形按最长的一条缩放" : "Hatched bars are strict counts, made only when another AI coding tool is named too. Bars are scaled to the largest"}
      </p>
    </div>
  )
}

{
  section === "body" && (
    <div class="wrap report-body">
      <Figure
        id="tools"
        lang={lang}
        heading={
          zh
            ? `Claude Code 被提到的次数领先，Cursor 和 GitHub Copilot 紧随其后`
            : `Claude Code leads. Cursor and GitHub Copilot follow.`
        }
        sub={
          zh
            ? "职位描述里提到各工具的全球在招岗位数，条形按最长的一条缩放。斜线条是严格计数（因此是下限），背后的轮廓是只看这个词时的数量"
            : "Open postings worldwide whose description names each tool, with bars scaled to the largest. Hatched bars are strict counts, so lower bounds; the outline behind shows the count for the word alone"
        }
        alt={rows.map((r) => `${names[r.group]} ${r.count}`).join(", ")}
        source={zh ? `来源：Metix AI Platform 岗位数据，${isoDate(snapshot)}。` : `Source: Metix AI Platform, jobs, ${isoDate(snapshot)}.`}
        queries={[
          { file: "claude-code.json", endpoint: "POST /v1/jobs/query", spec: claude },
          { file: "cursor.json", endpoint: "POST /v1/jobs/query", spec: cursor },
          { file: "github-copilot.json", endpoint: "POST /v1/jobs/query", spec: copilot },
          { file: "codex.json", endpoint: "POST /v1/jobs/query", spec: codex },
          { file: "windsurf.json", endpoint: "POST /v1/jobs/query", spec: windsurf },
          { file: "any-tool.json", endpoint: "POST /v1/jobs/query", spec: anyTool },
        ]}
      >
        <BarList rows={barRows} label={zh ? "各工具被提到的岗位数" : "Postings naming each tool"} />
      </Figure>

      <section class="findings" aria-labelledby="findings-title">
        <h2 id="findings-title">{zh ? "数字说明了什么" : "What the numbers say"}</h2>
        {zh ? (
          <>
            <p>
              全球有 {number(lang, any)} 个在招岗位的职位描述至少提到五个 AI 编程工具之一，其中 {number(lang, lead.count)} 个提到 Claude
              Code，占 {pct(lead.count / any)}。
            </p>
            <p>
              各工具在美国的占比不同：Claude Code 是 {pct(lead.us_count / lead.count)}，{names[lowestUs.group]} 只有{" "}
              {pct(lowestUs.us_count / lowestUs.count)}。美国以外的招聘方同样在点名这些工具。
            </p>
            <p>
              Cursor、Codex 和 Windsurf 这几个词本身有别的意思（数据库游标、食品法典、帆板运动），抽检里只有九成多是指编程工具，所以只在同一段描述里还提到另一个 AI 编程工具时才计入。它们的数字是下限，图里的轮廓是只看这个词时的数量。
            </p>
          </>
        ) : (
          <>
            <p>
              Worldwide, {number(lang, any)} open postings name at least one of five AI coding tools in the job description, and{" "}
              {number(lang, lead.count)} of them name Claude Code, {pct(lead.count / any)}.
            </p>
            <p>
              The tools differ in where they are asked for: {pct(lead.us_count / lead.count)} of the Claude Code postings are in
              the US, against {pct(lowestUs.us_count / lowestUs.count)} for {names[lowestUs.group]}. Employers outside the US name
              these tools too.
            </p>
            <p>
              Cursor, Codex, and Windsurf are also ordinary words (a database cursor, a food standard, a water sport), and in the
              audit only about nine in ten matches meant the tool. So they count only when the same description names another AI
              coding tool. Their numbers are lower bounds, and the outline in the chart shows the count for the word alone.
            </p>
          </>
        )}
      </section>
    </div>
  )
}

{
  section === "method" &&
    (zh ? (
      <>
        <h3>统计范围</h3>
        <p>
          {longDate(lang, snapshot)} Metix AI Platform 上职位描述提到某个 AI 编程工具的在招岗位。Claude Code 和 GitHub Copilot
          按名称匹配。Cursor、Codex、Windsurf 需要同一段描述里还提到另一个 AI 编程工具。
        </p>
        <h3>抽检</h3>
        <p>
          agent 为每个工具读了 40 到 60 条描述，检查名称附近是否是 AI 编程的上下文。Claude Code 和 GitHub Copilot 都是 40 条里 40
          条。只看单词时，Cursor 60 条里 55 条，Codex 60 条里 55 条，Windsurf 60 条里 56 条，超过 5% 的误差线，所以收紧了条件；收紧后
          Cursor 60 条里 60 条。
        </p>
        <h3>计数</h3>
        <p>
          每个工具算全球和美国两次，另外三个工具再算一次只看单词的数量，最后算一次"至少提到一个"。全部是计数，每次 1 Credit，不读取岗位。重复发布没有合并。条件在{" "}
          <a href={`${REPO}/tree/main/cases/${entry.slug}/queries`}>queries/</a>。
        </p>
        <h3>局限</h3>
        <p>
          提到一个工具不等于要求会用它，有的描述只是介绍团队在用什么。匹配要求词都出现，不要求连在一起，抽检里没有发现因此误判的。这是快照当天的截面。
        </p>
      </>
    ) : (
      <>
        <h3>Population</h3>
        <p>
          Open postings on the Metix AI Platform on {longDate(lang, snapshot)} whose description names an AI coding tool. Claude
          Code and GitHub Copilot match by name. Cursor, Codex, and Windsurf count only when the same description also names
          another AI coding tool.
        </p>
        <h3>Audit</h3>
        <p>
          The agent read 40 to 60 descriptions per tool and checked the words around each name for AI-coding context. Claude Code
          and GitHub Copilot held in 40 of 40. The plain words held in 55 of 60 for Cursor, 55 of 60 for Codex, and 56 of 60 for
          Windsurf, past the 5% error line, so their condition was tightened; tightened, Cursor held in 60 of 60.
        </p>
        <h3>Counting</h3>
        <p>
          Each tool is counted worldwide and in the US, the three ambiguous words once more on their own, and once for postings
          that name any of the five. All counts, one Credit each, and no posting is read. Reposts are not collapsed. The
          conditions are in <a href={`${REPO}/tree/main/cases/${entry.slug}/queries`}>queries/</a>.
        </p>
        <h3>Limits</h3>
        <p>
          Naming a tool is not the same as requiring it; some descriptions only say what the team uses. A match needs every word
          but not side by side, and the audit found no case where that misled. This is one day, not a trend.
        </p>
      </>
    ))
}

<style>
  .card-body.size-full .big-label {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--f-ink);
  }
</style>
